            <ArticleTitle>[ELEMAGS apparatus and clinical experience in its use in the treatment of children with hypoacusis and otalgia].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>40-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>To enhance effectiveness of magnetotherapy in the treatment of otic diseases the authors propose to use impulse low-frequency electromagnetic field in combination with constant magnetic field. ELEMAGS equipment based on the above principles is introduced to treat cochlear neuritis and neurosensory hypoacusis in children.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
